tainers, bedroll, belt, boots, notepad, grappling hook, personal items. The hovercycle is assigned to most Scouts rather than owned, so it is in GM Notes. The armor is stored as this book''s light homemade suit, the passive nightvision scope as the catalog''s passive night sight. || CYBERNETICS: none to start. || The Note line (regarded as just another Reaver) and Equipment Available On Assignment are prose, in GM Notes."
